{
  "id": "ACT.3",
  "number": "3",
  "bookId": "ACT",
  "reference": "Shītwa Sha Batūng'Wa 3",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 26,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "3",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ACT 3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūpījiwa kwa nemehazu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lūshikū lūmò makanza ga sa kenda, Petelo na Yohana bajaga mu Hekalu kūjūlomba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walīho ngosha nemehazu kūfuma mu nda ya ng'wa nina, wabūūchiagwa būlī lūshikū, wiza watūūlwa ha nyago gwa hekalu, gwalīho gwitanagwa “Nsoga.” Hūna a banhū ūlū balingīla ū mu hekalu, wayūlomba bang'winhe shose shose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wababona a ba Petelo nū Yohana begeela kwingīla ū mu hekalu, ūbalomba bang'winhe shikolo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo a ba Petelo nū Yohana būnkalalīla; hūna būng'wīla gīkī, “Bebe alitūlolage!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'hana ūbalola, kūnū alisagīlwa kwanukūla shikolo kūfuma kūbo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Petelo ūng'wīla gīkī, “Ū nene natī na sabo nūūlū hela, gwike nakūkwinha īsho nalī nasho. Mu lina lya ng'wa Yesu Kilisito wa Nazaleti, būūkaga ūshimīze.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūndima ū nkono gwa būlyo, ūngūngūmūla; ī likanza lyenīlo ūguzuhiwa ū mu mhambala, nū mu maguha ga mu shing'ongwa shakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbūūka, wikīndīka; wandya kūshimīza. Wingīla nabo ū mu hekalu akūshimīzaga kūnū ūsata sata na kūnkumīlīja Mulungu! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pye a banhū būmona alīshimīza, kūnū akūnkumīlījaga Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būng'witegeleja gīkī, hū ng'wene ūyo wikalaga igashije akwilombelejaga ha mita gwa hekalu ūyo gūkitanagwa Nsoga. Bakakumya no, gūbajinjimaja ū mhayo ūyo gūkang'wilongela gwenūyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būlomeeji bo ng'wa Petelo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūyo akapījiwa kūfuma mu būlemehazu ng'wenūyo, akikala abadimile a ba Petelo nū Yohana, nose būshika ng'wibīndo litanagwa lya ng'wa Solomoni. A banhū bakakumya no, pye a bose būyūpeela bajile mo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Petelo aho wababona a banhū ūbawīla gīkī, “Bing'we bababa Baisilaeli, nibūlī mulīgūkumya ū mhayo gwenūyū, nūūlū nibūlī mulītūkalalīla a bise gītī twagwītaga na būdūla wise, nūūlū gīkī ū munhū ng'wenūyū twang'winhaga būdūla bo kūshimīza kūlwa wela wise? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Mulungu wa ng'wa Abulahamu na Isaka na Yakobo; ū Mulungu wa bakūlūgenji bise, wangūngūhije ū Ntūmami wakwe ū Yesu, ūyo mukanodeela, na kūnema kū būtongi bo ng'wa Pilato, nūūlū īkī ū Pilato ng'wenekīlī walī wamala kūlamula gīkī antaligūle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a bing'we ng'ūnema ū Ng'wela na Ntūngīlīja, ng'ūlomba kwinhwa munhū mūlagi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo ū Ng'winhi wa būpanga ng'ūmūlaga, alīyo ū Mulungu wanjūūkije kūfuma mu bafu, hama a bise hū tūlī bakaanīji bakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū, kūlwa kūlīzunya ī lina lya ng'wa Yesu, ū munhū ūyū muumanile na kale ng'wenūyū mulīmona waguzuhiagwa mu lina lyenīlo. Ū mhayo gwa kūlīzunya ī lina lyenīlo hū gwene ūyo gwang'winhaga mhola nshikanu gīkī kū būtongi wing'we! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike badūgū bane, namanile gīkī a bing'we na a batongeeji bing'we ng'wīyīta ī yenīyo mu būtūmana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū mu gīko gūkashikīīla ū mhayo go ng'wa Mulungu, ū gwa kūluhiwa kwa ng'wa Kilisito wakwe, gīt'ūmo walī wahayīla kūfuma kale, mu nzīla ya bahangi bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali lūūlū, galūkagi ng'wīnge ū mu shibi shing'we, shijimangūchiwe; makanza ga kwifuujiwa gize kūfuma kūlī Seeba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Antūme ū Yesu Kilisito, ūyo ahelilwe kūlwa nguno ying'we kūfuma kale na kale, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ūyo shing'wigeleelilwe kwikala ng'wigūlū kūshisha gashike a makanza ga shikolo shose kūgalūchiwa shibize hangī gīt'ūmo shaalī na kale; ūmo Mulungu ahayīlile kūfuma kale, mu nzīla ya bahangi bakwe beela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū Musa akahaya gīkī, ‘Ū Seeba Mulungu wing'we akūmubūūkīja kūfuma mu badūgū bing'we ng'hangi wa kūbiza gītī nene; ū ng'wenūyo shiigelile mung'wigwe mu yose īyo alamuwīle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munhū ose ose ūyo atūng'wigwa ū ng'hangi ng'wenūyo, akūkenaagūlwa īnjiwe gete ū mu banhū.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pye a bahangi, kūfuma kūlī Sang'weli, na a babo bakalondeela ha numa yakwe, bajihayaga na kūjikumūcha ī shikū jenīji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bing'we mulī baana ba bahangi, na ba būlagane ūbo Mulungu akabeeja na bakūlūgenji bise; gīt'ūmo akang'wīlīla Abulahamu gīkī, ‘Pyī ī ng'anda ja mu sī jikwīlūkīlwa lubango mu nzīla ya būbyīle wako.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Mulungu aho wanjūūcha ū Ntūmami wakwe akantūma kū bing'we tame, gīkī anekeje na kūmfuha būlī ng'wene ūyo alagalūke kwīnga mu shibi shakwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
